{"seq":4,"slug":"typestate-pattern","title":"类型状态模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/typestate-pattern","wordCount":809,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型状态模式\">类型状态模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>类型状态模式（Typestate Pattern）把状态机从<strong>运行时数据</strong>搬进<strong>编译期类型</strong>：每个状态是一个独立类型，状态转换由消耗 <code>self</code> 并返回新类型的方法表达。理解本篇的关键，是明白它换来了什么、付出了什么——用更多的类型与代码量，把整类&quot;非法状态转换&quot;从运行时报错变成编译失败。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态即类型</strong>：<code>Article&lt;Draft&gt;</code> 与 <code>Article&lt;Published&gt;</code> 是两个不同类型，只在合法状态下存在的方法才能被调用。</li>\n<li><strong>转换即所有权转移</strong>：转换方法接收 <code>self</code> 而非 <code>&amp;mut self</code>，旧状态被消耗，从类型层面杜绝&quot;转换后误用旧状态&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong><code>PhantomData</code> 是零成本载体</strong>：它让类型参数被&quot;使用&quot;以满足编译器，却不占用任何运行时内存。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心思想\">核心思想</h2><p>类型状态模式（Typestate Pattern）利用 Rust 的类型系统在<strong>编译期编码状态机</strong>，使非法的状态转换成为编译错误而非运行时 bug。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Draft&#10;    Draft --&gt; PendingReview : submit()&#10;    PendingReview --&gt; Published : approve()&#10;    PendingReview --&gt; Draft : reject()&#10;    Published --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Draft\n    Draft --&gt; PendingReview : submit()\n    PendingReview --&gt; Published : approve()\n    PendingReview --&gt; Draft : reject()\n    Published --&gt; [*]</pre><p>传统方法用枚举或布尔标记状态，状态检查在运行时完成；类型状态模式让每个状态成为独立类型，非法转换直接无法通过编译。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础实现-文章发布流程\">基础实现：文章发布流程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"struct Draft;&#10;struct PendingReview;&#10;struct Published;&#10;&#10;struct Article&lt;State&gt; {&#10;    title: String,&#10;    content: String,&#10;    state: std::marker::PhantomData&lt;State&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Article&lt;Draft&gt; {&#10;    fn new(title: String, content: String) -&gt; Self {&#10;        Article {&#10;            title,&#10;            content,&#10;            state: std::marker::PhantomData,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn submit(self) -&gt; Article&lt;PendingReview&gt; {&#10;        println!(&quot;文章 &#39;{}&#39; 已提交审核&quot;, self.title);&#10;        Article {&#10;            title: self.title,&#10;            content: self.content,&#10;            state: std::marker::PhantomData,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Article&lt;PendingReview&gt; {&#10;    fn approve(self) -&gt; Article&lt;Published&gt; {&#10;        println!(&quot;文章 &#39;{}&#39; 审核通过&quot;, self.title);&#10;        Article {&#10;            title: self.title,&#10;            content: self.content,&#10;            state: std::marker::PhantomData,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn reject(self) -&gt; Article&lt;Draft&gt; {&#10;        println!(&quot;文章 &#39;{}&#39; 被退回&quot;, self.title);&#10;        Article {&#10;            title: self.title,&#10;            content: self.content,&#10;            state: std::marker::PhantomData,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Article&lt;Published&gt; {&#10;    fn view(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;str {&#10;        &amp;self.content&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let article = Article::&lt;Draft&gt;::new(&#10;        &quot;Rust 类型状态&quot;.into(),&#10;        &quot;利用类型系统编码状态机...&quot;.into(),&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    let article = article.submit();&#10;    let article = article.approve();&#10;    println!(&quot;已发布内容: {}&quot;, article.view());&#10;&#10;    // article.submit(); // 编译错误：Published 状态没有 submit 方法&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>struct Draft;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct PendingReview;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Published;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Article&#x3C;State> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state: std::marker::PhantomData&#x3C;State>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Article&#x3C;Draft> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn new(title: String, content: String) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state: std::marker::PhantomData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn submit(self) -> Article&#x3C;PendingReview> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"文章 '{}' 已提交审核\", self.title);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            title: self.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content: self.content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state: std::marker::PhantomData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Article&#x3C;PendingReview> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn approve(self) -> Article&#x3C;Published> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"文章 '{}' 审核通过\", self.title);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            title: self.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content: self.content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state: std::marker::PhantomData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn reject(self) -> Article&#x3C;Draft> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"文章 '{}' 被退回\", self.title);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            title: self.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content: self.content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state: std::marker::PhantomData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Article&#x3C;Published> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn view(&#x26;self) -> &#x26;str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x26;self.content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let article = Article::&#x3C;Draft>::new(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"Rust 类型状态\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"利用类型系统编码状态机...\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let article = article.submit();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let article = article.approve();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"已发布内容: {}\", article.view());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // article.submit(); // 编译错误：Published 状态没有 submit 方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"phantomdata-的作用\">PhantomData 的作用</h2><p><code>PhantomData&lt;T&gt;</code> 告诉编译器类型参数 <code>T</code> 被使用了，但不占用实际内存空间（零大小）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>PhantomData 用法</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型状态标记</td>\n<td><code>PhantomData&lt;State&gt;</code></td>\n<td>标识当前状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期标记</td>\n<td><code>PhantomData&lt;&amp;&#39;a T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>表达&quot;拥有引用&quot;的语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有权标记</td>\n<td><code>PhantomData&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>表达&quot;逻辑上拥有 T&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"建造者模式与类型状态\">建造者模式与类型状态</h2><p>类型状态模式非常适合实现<strong>编译期安全的建造者（Builder）</strong>，确保必填字段不被遗漏。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"struct NoHost;&#10;struct HasHost(String);&#10;struct NoPort;&#10;struct HasPort(u16);&#10;&#10;struct ServerConfigBuilder&lt;H, P&gt; {&#10;    host: H,&#10;    port: P,&#10;    max_connections: Option&lt;u32&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl ServerConfigBuilder&lt;NoHost, NoPort&gt; {&#10;    fn new() -&gt; Self {&#10;        ServerConfigBuilder {&#10;            host: NoHost,&#10;            port: NoPort,&#10;            max_connections: None,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;P&gt; ServerConfigBuilder&lt;NoHost, P&gt; {&#10;    fn host(self, host: &amp;str) -&gt; ServerConfigBuilder&lt;HasHost, P&gt; {&#10;        ServerConfigBuilder {&#10;            host: HasHost(host.to_string()),&#10;            port: self.port,&#10;            max_connections: self.max_connections,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;H&gt; ServerConfigBuilder&lt;H, NoPort&gt; {&#10;    fn port(self, port: u16) -&gt; ServerConfigBuilder&lt;H, HasPort&gt; {&#10;        ServerConfigBuilder {&#10;            host: self.host,&#10;            port: HasPort(port),&#10;            max_connections: self.max_connections,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;H, P&gt; ServerConfigBuilder&lt;H, P&gt; {&#10;    fn max_connections(mut self, max: u32) -&gt; Self {&#10;        self.max_connections = Some(max);&#10;        self&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl ServerConfigBuilder&lt;HasHost, HasPort&gt; {&#10;    fn build(self) -&gt; ServerConfig {&#10;        ServerConfig {&#10;            host: self.host.0,&#10;            port: self.port.0,&#10;            max_connections: self.max_connections.unwrap_or(100),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct ServerConfig {&#10;    host: String,&#10;    port: u16,&#10;    max_connections: u32,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let config = ServerConfigBuilder::new()&#10;        .host(&quot;0.0.0.0&quot;)&#10;        .port(8080)&#10;        .max_connections(500)&#10;        .build();&#10;&#10;    // ServerConfigBuilder::new().build(); // 编译错误：缺少 host 和 port&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;服务器: {}:{}&quot;, config.host, config.port);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>struct NoHost;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct HasHost(String);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct NoPort;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct HasPort(u16);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;H, P> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host: H,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port: P,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    max_connections: Option&#x3C;u32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;NoHost, NoPort> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn new() -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ServerConfigBuilder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            host: NoHost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            port: NoPort,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            max_connections: None,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;P> ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;NoHost, P> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn host(self, host: &#x26;str) -> ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;HasHost, P> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ServerConfigBuilder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            host: HasHost(host.to_string()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            port: self.port,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            max_connections: self.max_connections,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;H> ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;H, NoPort> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn port(self, port: u16) -> ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;H, HasPort> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ServerConfigBuilder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            host: self.host,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            port: HasPort(port),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            max_connections: self.max_connections,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;H, P> ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;H, P> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn max_connections(mut self, max: u32) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.max_connections = Some(max);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl ServerConfigBuilder&#x3C;HasHost, HasPort> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn build(self) -> ServerConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ServerConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            host: self.host.0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            port: self.port.0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            max_connections: self.max_connections.unwrap_or(100),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ServerConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    max_connections: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config = ServerConfigBuilder::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .host(\"0.0.0.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .port(8080)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .max_connections(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ServerConfigBuilder::new().build(); // 编译错误：缺少 host 和 port</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"服务器: {}:{}\", config.host, config.port);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"sealed-trait-封装状态\">Sealed Trait 封装状态</h2><p>使用 Sealed Trait 防止外部代码定义新状态，确保状态转换的完整性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"mod state {&#10;    mod sealed {&#10;        pub trait Sealed {}&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub trait ConnectionState: sealed::Sealed {}&#10;&#10;    pub struct Disconnected;&#10;    pub struct Connected;&#10;    pub struct Authenticated;&#10;&#10;    impl sealed::Sealed for Disconnected {}&#10;    impl sealed::Sealed for Connected {}&#10;    impl sealed::Sealed for Authenticated {}&#10;&#10;    impl ConnectionState for Disconnected {}&#10;    impl ConnectionState for Connected {}&#10;    impl ConnectionState for Authenticated {}&#10;}&#10;&#10;use state::*;&#10;&#10;struct Connection&lt;S: ConnectionState&gt; {&#10;    addr: String,&#10;    _state: std::marker::PhantomData&lt;S&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Connection&lt;Disconnected&gt; {&#10;    fn connect(self) -&gt; Connection&lt;Connected&gt; {&#10;        Connection {&#10;            addr: self.addr,&#10;            _state: std::marker::PhantomData,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Connection&lt;Connected&gt; {&#10;    fn authenticate(self, _token: &amp;str) -&gt; Connection&lt;Authenticated&gt; {&#10;        Connection {&#10;            addr: self.addr,&#10;            _state: std::marker::PhantomData,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Connection&lt;Authenticated&gt; {&#10;    fn query(&amp;self, sql: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;        format!(&quot;在 {} 上执行: {}&quot;, self.addr, sql)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mod state {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mod sealed {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pub trait Sealed {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub trait ConnectionState: sealed::Sealed {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub struct Disconnected;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub struct Connected;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub struct Authenticated;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impl sealed::Sealed for Disconnected {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impl sealed::Sealed for Connected {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impl sealed::Sealed for Authenticated {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impl ConnectionState for Disconnected {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impl ConnectionState for Connected {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    impl ConnectionState for Authenticated {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use state::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Connection&#x3C;S: ConnectionState> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addr: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _state: std::marker::PhantomData&#x3C;S>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Connection&#x3C;Disconnected> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn connect(self) -> Connection&#x3C;Connected> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Connection {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            addr: self.addr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _state: std::marker::PhantomData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Connection&#x3C;Connected> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn authenticate(self, _token: &#x26;str) -> Connection&#x3C;Authenticated> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Connection {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            addr: self.addr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _state: std::marker::PhantomData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Connection&#x3C;Authenticated> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn query(&#x26;self, sql: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        format!(\"在 {} 上执行: {}\", self.addr, sql)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型状态-vs-枚举状态对比\">类型状态 vs 枚举状态对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>类型状态模式</th>\n<th>枚举状态模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非法转换检测</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时开销</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>match 分支 + 可能的 panic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>较多（每个状态一个类型）</td>\n<td>较少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>状态在编译期确定</td>\n<td>状态可动态变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>API 设计、协议实现</td>\n<td>状态需要运行时决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用场景\">实际应用场景</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>状态转换链</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP 请求构建</td>\n<td><code>Builder → WithUrl → WithMethod → Request</code></td>\n<td>确保 URL 和方法已设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库连接</td>\n<td><code>Disconnected → Connected → InTransaction</code></td>\n<td>避免未连接时执行查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件操作</td>\n<td><code>Closed → Open → Locked</code></td>\n<td>防止对已关闭文件的操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付流程</td>\n<td><code>Created → Authorized → Captured → Refunded</code></td>\n<td>保证支付状态合法流转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类型状态模式用<strong>类型</strong>编码状态机，使非法状态转换成为编译错误而非运行时 bug。</li>\n<li>每个状态是独立类型，转换方法消耗 <code>self</code> 并返回新类型，<code>PhantomData</code> 零成本承载状态标记。</li>\n<li>它最适合建造者模式与协议/API 设计，能在编译期保证必填字段与调用顺序。</li>\n<li>代价是代码量较多、状态必须在编译期确定；状态需要运行时动态变化时应改用枚举。</li>\n<li><code>Sealed Trait</code> 可封闭状态集合，防止外部代码新增状态而破坏转换完整性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型状态模式","id":"类型状态模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心思想","id":"核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"基础实现：文章发布流程","id":"基础实现-文章发布流程"},{"level":2,"text":"PhantomData 的作用","id":"phantomdata-的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"建造者模式与类型状态","id":"建造者模式与类型状态"},{"level":2,"text":"Sealed Trait 封装状态","id":"sealed-trait-封装状态"},{"level":2,"text":"类型状态 vs 枚举状态对比","id":"类型状态-vs-枚举状态对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用场景","id":"实际应用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误处理 Result 与 Option","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/error-handling"},"next":{"title":"线程与消息传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/threads-and-channels"}}